diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 23bc8a3..0f50953 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -2,8 +2,15 @@
 
 A small ASP.NET Core (net8.0) minimal API for managing work items: create, list, update and
 delete tasks, each with a state (`Open`, `InProgress`, `Done`), a priority (`Low`, `Medium`,
-`High`) and timestamps. Storage is an in-memory store seeded with a few sample tasks; all
-`/tasks` routes require a bearer token.
+`High`), an optional due date and timestamps. Storage is an in-memory store seeded with a few
+sample tasks; all `/tasks` routes require a bearer token.
+
+## Due dates
+
+Every task has a nullable `dueDate`, sent as an ISO-8601 instant (`"2026-09-01T17:00:00+00:00"`)
+and returned on every task. It is optional on both POST and PUT: omit it, or send `null`, and the
+task has no due date. Because PUT replaces the whole task, a PUT body without `dueDate` clears any
+due date the task had - send the current value back to keep it.
 
 ## Layout
 
